# Filters for a mutants-check-* run (one cargo-mutants argument per line).
# check-5 (2026-10-20): pre-audit fixes (filing window and pauses, cancel of a
# part-paid claim, emergency exit lock, staker yield carry, payout address,
# treasury payout while paused).
-f protection-pool/src/admin.rs
-f protection-pool/src/claim.rs
-f protection-pool/src/settings.rs
-f protection-pool/src/stake.rs
-f protection-pool/src/storage.rs
-f protection-pool/src/vault.rs
-F 'in (pause|submit_claim|cancel_claim|consistent_with_live|stake|check_beneficiary|set_beneficiary|withdraw|emergency_exit|claim_yield|paused_secs_since|withdraw_yield)$'
